{"kind":"request","text":"ES-1: a session answer carries the signer's standing on request.\n\nWhy. Explore needs the standing of the instance (section 5.7 of\n`notes/2026-11-14-act-environment.md`). Ruling `695a1839` chose the\nsession answer as the first source, and `8b661e72` gives the\nroute.\n\nWork:\n1. `POST /v1/scopes/\u003cmembership\u003e/sessions?standing=1` answers\n   `{ok, token, session, standing}`. Without the option the answer\n   keeps its three members. `standing` is the value that\n   `standingOf` makes in the same issuance, with its membership\n   head, and with no `at` and no `fresh`.\n2. The client reader asks with the option. It checks the value\n   fields, the native pin, and that the key, the member, the\n   membership and its incarnation equal those of the request and\n   of the claims. A value that fails a check gives no standing and\n   keeps the session.\n3. The session cache keeps the value with the token. An entry with\n   no value gives no standing.\n4. A refusal of a submit by the scope with an authority reason\n   ends the cached session.\n5. `standingIn` of `packages/mcp/src/inventory.ts` goes. The MCP\n   inventory takes role, actions and controller state from the\n   value. With no value it reports unknown.\n\nThis request adds no scope kind, no platform definition name, no\ncapability name or form, no tool family, no record model and no\nexport of `packages/contract`.","body":{"conditions":"One owner test runs the real rolling pair: a new reader against an answer of three members, and an older strict reader against a Worker that got no option. A test shows each refused check of item 2 by name. The MCP inventory case shows an agent whose controller is inactive as not eligible. The settings and tool documents state the option. No row of observes is settled by the value. Side lane with EK-1: it may share that head; its gate comes after AE-1.","target_head":"6728059211cee75dc0f6fdd104ef52a44c5f7da0","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}